{"title":"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 38","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_38\">Problem 38</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 38\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In a right triangle with sides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, and hypotenuse <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, the altitude drawn on the hypotenuse is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. Then: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/e/10e40b094b0694db74905aa0a1c391ca613d14f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ ab = x^2 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac {1}{a} + \\frac {1}{b} = \\frac {1}{x} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ a^2 + b^2 = 2x^2 \\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac {1}{x^2} = \\frac {1}{a^2} + \\frac {1}{b^2} \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac {1}{x} = \\frac {b}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"77\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The area of this triangle can be expressed in two ways; the first being <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/8/e28d3480da9f0716865cfc2bd75edc5817d9dafa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{ab}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"19\" height=\"37\" /> (as this is a right triangle), and the second being <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/3/b3397ccb3ed9eb28564bde43ecdab1c7f6f47933.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{cx}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"34\" />. But by the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pythagorean_Theorem\" title=\"Pythagorean Theorem\">Pythagorean Theorem</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/0/c10b21a25996692869fda944de19c378745b20cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=\\sqrt{a^2+b^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"104\" height=\"21\" />. Thus a second way of finding the area of the triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/e/b0ec694d5b119069cb15533be30c32f50822c3e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x\\sqrt{a^2+b^2}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"86\" height=\"43\" />. By setting them equal to each other we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/e/7fee1cb7a32dcd0a41daafb92993aff838b96fc8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{ab}{\\sqrt{a^2+b^2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"110\" height=\"44\" />, and we can observe that the correct answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/7876a52b9e8fb1402d38eba77fd9987689e76a28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) \\ }}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"55\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anduran\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME\" title=\"1956 AHSME\">1956 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1956 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1956\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 37\">Problem 37</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 39\">Problem 39</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_P